21.9. Race Condition vs Thread Safety

| Feature         | Race Condition    | Thread Safety |
| --------------- | ----------------   -------------  |
| Shared Data     | Yes               | Yes           |
| Synchronization | ❌ No             | ✅ Yes        |
| Correct Result  | ❌ Not Guaranteed | ✅ Guaranteed |
| Predictable     | ❌ No             | ✅ Yes        |

21.10 Race Condition vs Deadlock

| Feature         | Race Condition               | Deadlock          |
| --------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------- |
| Cause           | Concurrent modification      | Waiting for locks |
| Progress        | Continues with wrong results | Stops completely  |
| Data Corruption | ✅ Possible                  | ❌ Usually No     |
| Threads Blocked | ❌ Not necessarily           | ✅ Yes            |

